activity Collect Data
activity Analyze Data
activity Write Draft Report
activity Review Report
activity Approve Report
activity Publish Report
activity Gather Feedback
activity Revise Report
bind Collect Data: Data Points
bind Analyze Data: Report Accuracy
bind Approve Report: Approval Status
bind Gather Feedback: Feedback Type
bind Revise Report: Revision Count
Data Points: integer between 100 and 10000
Report Accuracy: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Approval Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Feedback Type: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Revision Count: integer between 0 and 5
Init[Collect Data] | |
Precedence[Approve Report, Analyze Data] | | |
Precedence[Publish Report, Approve Report] | | |
Chain Response[Write Draft Report, Review Report] | | |0,1,h
Response[Approve Report, Publish Report] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |0,3,d
Existence[Publish Report] | |
Response[Gather Feedback, Revise Report] |A.Feedback Type is Negative | |
Absence6[Revise Report] | |
Not Chain Response[Revise Report, Revise Report] |A.Revision Count > 3 | |
Precedence[Write Draft Report, Analyze Data] | | |